# Non-cube cuboid: 3 wide, 3 deep, 2 tall. Only U/D layers can quarter-turn.
cuboid 3x3x2

case 5.1 Drag F right column up on 3x3x2
note R-axis layers are 3x2: a quarter-turn gesture becomes the legal half turn R2
wait 0.4
drag F@2,-1,2 F@2,1,2 0.5
settle
expect feedback turn R2
expect state R2

case 5.2 Drag F top row left
note U layer is 3x3: an ordinary quarter turn U
reset
wait 0.3
drag F@2,1,2 F@-2,1,2 0.5
settle
expect state U

case 5.3 Drag U front row right
note F-axis layers are 3x2: half turn F2
reset
wait 0.3
drag U@-2,1,2 U@2,1,2 0.5
settle
expect state F2

case 5.4 Notation "R" on 3x3x2
note Rejected: a quarter R is not a legal move here
reset
moves R
wait 0.3
expect feedback rejected
expect solved

case 5.5 Scramble and solve 3x3x2
note IDA* solution plays back to solved
scramble 12 3
wait 0.5
solve
settle
expect feedback solution
expect solved
